        "evidence": "Pinned Windows additional-chain test_refcount: backbuffer container is its IDirect3DSwapChain9; surface public count starts at one and has an independent device pin. Pinned swapchain implementation pins its parent only at public zero/nonzero edges."
      },
      {
        "file": "d3d9-private-surface.c",
        "sha256": "34898c6ddfd4895d464a4cf35b630160b0e8730bb71607089b165fa0f319200c",
        "blobSha1": "1ea8c60a4fd48a080d35ed56bcb134534260ec55",
        "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/surface.c",
        "evidence": "Non-texture surface AddRef/Release retain the device and swapchain/texture storage on public zero/nonzero edges; a held surface keeps its container alive."
      },
      {
        "file": "d3d9-com-swapchain.c",
        "sha256": "4e4d530b24fb6ebe2c27be8c173d6d2df9d230de71e3779ba2a8af11ffc231d9",
